{"title": "Song of Rest", "pageid": 3378, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Song_of_Rest", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bugs", "Resource replenishing actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Song_of_Rest.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Song_of_Rest.webp/300px-Song_of_Rest.webp, /w/images/1/1c/Song_of_Rest.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Song_of_Rest.webp/300px-Song_of_Rest.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Song_of_Rest.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Song of Rest</b> is an action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">bards</a> at level 2. This ability allows the bard to rejuvenate their party as if they took a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>. It is usable once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nUse your craft to soothe. You and your allies are revitalised as though you had taken a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_SongOfRest</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SongOfRest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SongOfRest\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action can only be used in situations when it is possible to use a normal short rest. In particular, it is not available if any party member is engaged in combat.</li>\n<li>This ability refreshes when using the <a href=\"/wiki/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration Pod</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>, unlike 'normal' short rests, which do not refresh.</li>\n<li>This ability is quite different from the tabletop version. That version instead lets bards help themselves and their allies to regain more hit points during short rests, increasing the amount by between 1d6 and 1d12, depending on the bard's level, as long as any amount of Hit Dice are spent.</li>\n<li>As of Patch 5, silenced characters cannot use this action.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action incorrectly recharges whenever the party fast travels to a different region (i.e., whenever the dialog box for confirming travel to a different region appears), allowing for unlimited short rests.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki